But Dad wouldn't kill Alex!

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:54.580
That's right!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.580
It wasn't little Alex that
your dad wanted to kill.

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:01.200
No... You're lying...

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.120
Nope!

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:09.870
Because the password that he
set on the drive was "Moriarty"!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:15.660
But how was I to know that somebody
else was wearing your clothes?

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:21.330
I followed the transmitter Moran set and...

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:24.790
...I found little Alex!

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.830
The sticker you found in Alexandra's things.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:32.580
That was a transmitter.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.830
Then the one who attacked me was...

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.290
Moran.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.080
He knew Moriarty was going to the East Side.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:44.160
And he used his name as the password.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.000
Yup!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:50.500
But Alex was totally my type,
so it all worked out...

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:57.040
I wish you could've heard her last words...

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.290
What did she say?

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:03.580
Don't, Moriarty!

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.790
Don't kill her!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.410
Stay back!

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:08.870
What did she say?

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:46.870
James, I'll always love you!

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:52.700
So I want you to always
keep loving this world.

00:22:54.080 --> 00:22:57.540
In other words, Alex...

00:22:57.540 --> 00:23:00.410
...died instead of you!

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:05.160
What's going on here?

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:06.910
Hey, Moriarty!

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:13.500
Hey, you know what happened
to the wombs I cut out?

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:16.000
No! Don't do it!

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:20.870
Alex's was especially delicio--

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:36.500
Sherlock.

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:41.290
Please, Sherlock Holmes.

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:04.870
"No More Nyan-Nyan"

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:06.830
"The Detective's Cat Figurines" "When there's a job
for a detective, the cat in their room meows."
"If the detectives are willing to work,
the cat's arm is raised."
